ully discriminate, or facilitate unlawful conduct.</p></section><p class="note">Last updated: 8 September 2026. Pre-launch terms; not legal advice. Mandatory consumer rights remain unaffected.</p><footer><a href="./privacy">Privacy</a><a href="./refund">Refunds</a><a href="./support">Support</a></footer><p class="flow">Flow note — These terms define the educational, licensing, and responsibility boundaries of the Recruiter Lab product before live sales.</p></main></body></html><style>:root{--ink:#111;--paper:#f5f3ed;--line:#cbc8bf;--muted:#69675f}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}main{max-width:920px;margin:auto;padding:42px 24px 70px}.back,footer a{color:inherit}.kicker{margin-top:70px;font:700 10px ui-monospace,monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:clamp(64px,12vw,120px);letter-spacing:-.07em;line-height:.85;margin:18px 0 36px}.lead{font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;max-width:720px}section{padding:28px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}h2{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 10px}p{line-height:1.7}section p,.note{color:#55534d}.note{font-size:12px}footer{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid #111;padding-top:24px;margin-top:40px;font-size:12px}.flow{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}</style>